    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Never pretend real-time",
      "items": [
        "Offline keeps the last known status, clearly marked with its update time",
        "The diagnosed reason is shown as-is, because the remote page cannot say it"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Channels stay independent",
      "items": [
        "DEGRADED keeps the workbench tunnel while aggregation recovers",
        "No periodic polling: reconnect re-queries the snapshot",
